OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,6,     F2/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,7,     Fearly years of Smith's marriage to
OL,8,     Fa lawyer, Frederick Meadows White.
OL,9,G1700 In Tune
OL,10,     FKatie welcomes Carolin Widmann to
OL,11,     FIn Tune. Phelim McDermott on
OL,12,     Fdirecting Tao of Glass.
OL,13,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,14,     FLive at the BBC Proms: the BBC
OL,15,     FSymphony Orchestra conducted by
OL,16,     FSakari Oramo in Sibelius's
OL,17,     FSymphony No.2, Turnage's Festen
OL,18,     FSuite, and, with Guy Johnston,
OL,19,     FBritten's Cello Symphony.
